  "name": "Durable",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Defy Death.</strong> You have Advantage on Death Saving Throws.</p><p><strong>Speedy Recovery.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you can expend one of your Hit Point Dice, roll the die, and regain a number of Hit Points equal to the roll.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-2mnen4ekEgf4G7tw\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Speedy Recovery (Largest Die)</strong> activity expends your largest available Hit Die and the <strong>(Smallest Die)</strong> activity expends the smallest available Hit Die (only important when multiclassing, otherwise the results are the same).</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
